{"game":"veloren-veloren","category":"vfx-blood-finishers","cell":3,"verdict":"STRONG","depth":"full","donor_path":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/veloren-veloren/common/src/states/finisher_melee.rs","licence":"GPL-3.0 (LICENSE, Version 3, 29 June 2007)","licence_class":"copyleft","target_module":"src/fight/finisher.ts","parity_row":9,"pattern_tags":["new:combo-gate","new:spend-to-scale","new:exhaust-once","new:stun-gated-bonus","new:combo-decay-window"],"data_fields":[{"name":"finisher_minimum_combo","donor_constant":"12 (sword); 20 (axe execute, hammer judgement); 1 (axe keelhaul, fracture)","unit":"count","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"assets/common/abilities/sword/heavy_guillotine.ron:20"},{"name":"finisher_consumption_rule","donor_constant":"All (default); Half = ceil(combo/2); Cost = minimum","unit":"none","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"common/src/states/utils.rs:1967"},{"name":"scaling_max_factor_attack","donor_constant":"20","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"assets/common/abilities/axe/keelhaul.ron:25"},{"name":"scaling_max_factor_buff","donor_constant":"10","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"assets/common/abilities/axe/fracture.ron:26"},{"name":"scaled_damage_per_factor","donor_constant":"2","unit":"units","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"assets/common/abilities/axe/keelhaul.ron:14"},{"name":"finisher_base_damage","donor_constant":"50 (basic mighty strike, heavy guillotine); 70 (execute); 25 (judgement); 0 (keelhaul); 16 (fracture)","unit":"units","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"assets/common/abilities/sword/basic_mighty_strike.ron:8"},{"name":"stun_bonus_heavy_guillotine","donor_constant":"1.0","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"assets/common/abilities/sword/heavy_guillotine.ron:16"},{"name":"stun_bonus_judgement","donor_constant":"2.5","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"assets/common/abilities/hammer/judgement.ron:16"},{"name":"buildup_duration","donor_constant":"0.2 (basic, keelhaul, fracture); 0.3 (judgement); 0.4 (heavy guillotine); 0.5 (execute)","unit":"s","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"assets/common/abilities/axe/keelhaul.ron:3"},{"name":"combo_decay_start","donor_constant":"7.5","unit":"s","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"common/src/comp/combo.rs:4"},{"name":"energy_cost_finisher","donor_constant":"20 (sword); 0 (axe keelhaul, execute; hammer judgement)","unit":"units","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"assets/common/abilities/sword/basic_mighty_strike.ron:2"}],"best_idea":"A finisher is a combo-gated state: it is allowed only at a minimum combo, spends the combo on its single strike, and scales that strike by the combo spent, with an extra bonus only against a stunned target.","decision":"adapt","decision_why":"A combo-gated finisher fits our rules (engage is a state change, kills server-verified) and gives players a reason to hold combo for row 9. Adapt: read one combo value for spend and scale (the donor reads two), guard the zero-minimum case, tie the stun bonus to our guard/stagger state (row 3).","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"In a duel the finisher is greyed at 11 combo and lit at 12 (minimum 12). A server test: with minimum 1 and the Half rule, at 10 combo the hit deals 20 damage, the combo drops to 5, the hit lands once even if the action tick runs twice; a stunned target takes an extra 100% of that hit."}
